_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464120/extras/e7ed3cd46a10c4e7100f2945870d96d4.poster.avif?t=1608648761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464120/extras/e7ed3cd46a10c4e7100f2945870d96d4.webm?t=1608648761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Awakening before a church stood in the middle of a meadow, Mutsuki follows a white cat inside and begins to explore. Their wristwatch reads 23:50, on the 15th of July 1927. After 600 seconds have passed, Mutsuki must defeat the monsters that appear and escape from this nightmare.",
